version: "0.1.0"
date-released: 2026-08-24
abstract: >-
  This release gives exact computer-assisted nonexistence proofs for simple
  graphs with Laplacian spectrum {0,1,...,n-1} at orders 16 and 20. The
  deposited materials include the two certificate archives, exact verifiers,
  coverage records and replay logs. The results concern only these two orders
  and have not undergone external peer review.
keywords:
  - spectral graph theory
  - Laplacian spectrum
  - computer-assisted proof
  - exact computation
  - Farkas certificate
  - graph nonexistence
